## Required API Endpoints

### Health

`GET /api/health`

Returns backend availability and service status.

### Projects

`GET /api/projects`

Returns all available projects.

`POST /api/projects`

Creates a new project.

`GET /api/projects/{project_id}`

Returns project details.

`DELETE /api/projects/{project_id}`

Deletes a project.

### Upload

`POST /api/upload`

Accepts a video file and returns upload metadata.

Validate file type and size.

### Agent Pipeline

`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/process`

Starts simulated agent processing.

`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/status`

Returns current processing status.

`POST /api/projects/{project_id}/advance`

Advances the pipeline manually for demonstration mode.

### Outputs

`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/outputs`

Returns generated mock outputs.

`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/metadata`

Returns generated SEO metadata.

### Export

`GET /api/projects/{project_id}/export`

Generates and returns a downloadable ZIP asset bundle.

